{"slug":"/components/carousels","title":"Animated React Carousel Components — Planes","desc":"React carousel components and marquees with spring physics: 3D cover flow, cylinder and arc carousels, an image wheel, a parallax marquee, and a logo wall.","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:px-10 lg:px-14 xl:px-16\"><section><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl pb-10 pt-2 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">Animated React Carousel Components</h1><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Ways to move a row of content past the viewer. A 3D cover flow you can drag or scroll, a cylinder and an arc that curve the row, a wheel that blurs everything but the frame in focus, a gallery that stretches the hovered frame, a parallax marquee, a velocity-driven marquee, and a logo wall that cycles cell by cell.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] text-muted-foreground/70\">11<!-- --> components ·<!-- --> <a class=\"underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/components\">Browse all components</a></p></div><h2 class=\"sr-only\">Components</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 p-1 transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-secondary\" href=\"/components/logo-wall\"><div class=\"aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-muted\"><img src=\"/thumbs/logo-wall.webp\" alt=\"Logo Wall preview\" width=\"960\" height=\"557\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full object-cover\"/></div><div class=\"px-1.5 pb-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h3 class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground p-1\">Logo Wall</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock 